# Excel lock files Excel leaves behind while a workbook is open.
~$*

# The catalog is NOT in git. It is ~11 MB of derived data rewritten in full on
# every refresh, so committing it added that much permanent, undeltifiable
# history per changed day. It is published as a rolling GitHub release asset
# instead and fetched at build time. See scripts/vercel-build.sh and DEPLOY.md.
data/courses.db
data/CATALOG_SOURCE
data/BUILD_PROBE
